  "findings": [
    "aivm cloud-init on cloud-init 25.3 failed to create the aivm-bootstrap user and logged a numeric-group groupadd failure; fixed in aivm 7952eaf before these runs.",
    "With one attached folder, the unprivileged canary search could not read AIVM's root-only staging mount and reported itself incomplete; the guest user has passwordless sudo, so the search now runs as guest root (7cfdf22) and completed with the canary not found.",
    "dev/aivm_constrained_acceptance.py had never been run on a VM and failed with broker_failed: its policy named a different credential file than its spec, and it wrote the credential with a trailing newline that the native reader refuses. Both fixed, with a regression test."
  ]
